{"title":"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/036a8f2f244f0d75849cd4b62b7247592f72eeab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt{2}}-\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"187\" height=\"32\" /> is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/6/a56386a1fa3c24a6da31ee3398e958ea5b8c156a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 2\\quad \\text{(B) } 2\\sqrt{3}\\quad \\text{(C) } 4\\sqrt{2}\\quad \\text{(D) } \\sqrt{6}\\quad \\text{(E) } 2\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"354\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Square the expression:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/2/94292898f736630df30278bb565f15d98b0cf89d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt{2}}-\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt{2}})^2=3+\\sqrt{2}-2\\sqrt{(3+\\sqrt{2})(3-\\sqrt{2})}+3-2\\sqrt{2}=6-2\\sqrt{9-8}=6-2\\sqrt{1}=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"806\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/e/cee8cd4b012911e50fc88478d7ce7964fd23040e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow\\sqrt{3+2\\sqrt{2}}-\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt{2}}=\\sqrt{4}=2\\Rightarrow\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"345\" height=\"32\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME\" title=\"1970 AHSME\">1970 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1970 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1970\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSM